<div class="container"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="page-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Keamanan akun</span><h1>Ganti kata sandi</h1><p>Akun awal wajib memakai kata sandi baru sebelum fitur lain dapat digunakan.</p></div><form class="form-panel" method="post" action="/ubah-kata-sandi"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="current_password">Kata sandi saat ini</label><input class="form-control" id="current_password" name="current_password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></div><div class="mb-4"><label class="form-label" for="new_password">Kata sandi baru</label><input class="form-control" id="new_password" name="new_password" type="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required></div><button class="btn btn-success" type="submit">Perbarui kata sandi</button></form></div></div></div>